id=android-devices-dodge-boot-choice
name=Dodge same-slot boot choice
version=1.1.0
versionCode=2
author=nixos-android-devices contributors
description=Opt-in native same-slot Android/NixOS boot selector for Dodge. Entry/Action is read-only; explicit WebUI target buttons commit preference and request ordinary reboot. Requires supported KernelSU-patched BOOT4 and independent recovery.
